    <main class="admin-main" data-preorders-page data-preorder-waiting-page>
      <header class="admin-hero preorder-waiting-hero">
        <div>
          <p>PREORDER WAITING</p>
          <h1>預購等待區</h1>
          <span>已下單的預購會從採購區移到這裡，集中追蹤物流、到貨入庫、累計其他商品與待出貨狀態。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="preorder-waiting-hero-actions">
          <a class="ghost-button" href="./admin-preorders.html">新增預購單</a>
          <a class="ghost-button" href="./admin-purchase.html">回採購區</a>
          <button type="button" data-refresh-orders>重新整理</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="panel preorder-waiting-panel" data-preorder-list-panel>
        <div class="preorder-waiting-rule" role="note">
          <b>狀態與實際出貨分開管理</b>
          <span>物流運送中只是採購貨件的進度，不會先扣台灣現貨，也不會把未出貨尾款列為客戶欠款。到貨入庫後預設為「累計訂單／等待其他預購商品」，確認商品已齊後才可按「准許出貨」並轉成現貨出貨單。</span>
        </div>

        <section class="preorder-waiting-summary" data-preorder-waiting-summary aria-live="polite">
          <article class="is-total"><span>預購等待總數</span><strong>0</strong><small>0 位客戶／0 件商品</small></article>
          <article><span>已下單</span><strong>0</strong><small>等待進貨物流</small></article>
          <article><span>物流運送中</span><strong>0</strong><small>未入庫，不扣現貨</small></article>
          <article class="is-waiting"><span>累計訂單</span><strong>0</strong><small>已入庫，暫不出貨</small></article>
          <article class="is-ready"><span>准許出貨</span><strong>0</strong><small>商品已齊，可轉現貨單</small></article>
          <article class="is-overdue"><span>超過 12 天</span><strong>0</strong><small>需優先確認物流或累計原因</small></article>
        </section>

        <div class="preorder-waiting-flow" aria-label="預購等待流程">
          <span><i>1</i><b>已下單</b><small>離開採購區</small></span>
          <span><i>2</i><b>物流運送</b><small>追蹤進貨貨件</small></span>
          <span><i>3</i><b>已入庫／累計等待</b><small>等待其他預購商品</small></span>
          <span><i>4</i><b>商品已齊／准許出貨</b><small>才轉現貨出貨單</small></span>
        </div>

        <section class="preorder-freight-balance preorder-waiting-allocation" data-preorder-allocation aria-live="polite">
          <p class="empty-state">正在依客戶下單日期、產品編號、顏色與尺寸建立配貨順序與缺貨名單…</p>
        </section>

        <div class="filter-row preorder-waiting-filters">
          <label>搜尋預購／客戶／電話／SKU
            <input data-order-search placeholder="輸入預購單號、客戶、電話、物流單號、商品或 SKU" autocomplete="off">
          </label>
          <label class="sales-filter-buttons">業務
            <input type="hidden" data-order-sales-filter value="all">
            <span class="segmented-filter" data-order-sales-filter-buttons>
              <button type="button" class="is-active" data-order-sales-choice="all">全部</button>
              <button type="button" data-order-sales-choice="LINGZANZAN">LINGZANZAN</button>
              <button type="button" data-order-sales-choice="ANY">ANY</button>
            </span>
          </label>
          <label>等待狀態
            <select data-order-status-filter>
              <option value="all">全部等待中</option>
              <option value="ordered">已下單／進入預購等待</option>
              <option value="arrived">物流運送中</option>
              <option value="waiting_other_items">累計訂單／等待其他預購商品</option>
              <option value="ready_to_ship">商品已齊／准許出貨</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <input type="hidden" data-order-type-filter value="preorder">
        <div class="preorder-pager-host" data-preorder-pager-host></div>
        <div class="admin-list order-list preorder-waiting-list" data-admin-orders>
          <div class="empty">正在讀取預購等待資料…</div>
        </div>
      </section>
